{"data": [{"id": "2122101787171668225", "author_id": "1846568246381584384", "text": "@WesRoth They have just such a mediocre track record that nobody switches unless the finally manage a fable type splash on clear 1. Place", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:57:47.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/BobClowdr/status/2122101787171668225", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122036201658159280", "author_id": "879796718031732738", "text": "@WesRoth Argon kinda is a joke, but only because Hydrogen is so good. It's a fantastic update to 3.8 Flash, much more intelligent and capable. I've yet to try Carbon though, I'm a 20$ pleb and still locked out of it. 😉", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T18:37:10.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Freeeman_Gordon/status/2122036201658159280", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122013190834020628", "author_id": "910501574287482881", "text": "@WesRoth This would have been called AGI 3 years ago. Now it isn't the top 3 stories in AI. \n\nThe black swan is that 2027 is the year robotics gets solved and no one cares.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T17:05:44.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/theovonscousin/status/2122013190834020628", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122009899307524346", "author_id": "7183952", "text": "@WesRoth Damn, it looks well laid out too.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T16:52:39.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Gerry/status/2122009899307524346", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121994428810224025", "author_id": "2039118759055462400", "text": "@WesRoth Factorio is a great test because the factory never lies about what broke. Real business workflows do. The hard part I keep hitting isn't the 45-hour run, it's the agent knowing which step needs a human before it moves.", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T15:51:11.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/FutureInvoked/status/2121994428810224025", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121988766210683226", "author_id": "1482490355362709507", "text": "@WesRoth beat factorio and then made a video bragging about it 💀", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T15:28:41.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/BreezeOg1/status/2121988766210683226", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121982960140501493", "author_id": "2034618810666520576", "text": "@WesRoth have to be honest in that ive never made it to the rocket ship...", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T15:05:36.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/TheApeManRC/status/2121982960140501493", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121936254996816010", "author_id": "994794291871584257", "text": "@WesRoth for scale, human speedrunners finish default settings factorio in under 2 hours (the record is 1:59). so 45h isn't the impressive part.\n\nwhat is impressive is a model holding a plan together through 45 hours of logistics with no human nudging. long horizon coherence is the real", "lang": "en", "created_at": "2026-11-15T12:00:01.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/its_ronc/status/2121936254996816010", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 19, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2121929529820172611", "author_id": "1508034028670181376", "text": "@WesRoth google making